      "filename": "Massed Pipe Bands Parade - Highland Games at Helmsdale Sutherland Scotland (6070812993).jpg",
      "title": "File:Massed Pipe Bands Parade - Highland Games at Helmsdale Sutherland Scotland (6070812993).jpg",
